  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Introduction to .map()\r\n\r\n1. **Run the code** to see the lists appear on the screen.\r\n2. Compare the **Original List** card to the **Doubled List** card.\r\n3. Explore how **.map()** functions in code to transform the data. Have a conversation with the AI Tutor to explore this idea further.\r\n\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
